0 Quartermaster - contact indexer with a physical dwell latch
0 Name: quartermaster.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/quartermaster.txt
0 // 209 physical pieces, one SPIKE Prime hub and two medium angular motors.
0 // Motor A: crank/retained roller. Motor B: balanced latch, 0 closed / -45 deg open.
0 // Output is passive: no gear, driver or synthetic Geneva coupling.
0 // Shaft centres (X,Z): A=(0,0), output=(80,80); crank radius80 LDU.
0 // Contact plane Y=180; four slots have wall centres +/-20 and radii40..80 LDU.
0 // Saved datum: roller (0,180,-80), latch horizontal, A=B=0.
0 // LDraw 20 LDU/stud; 1 LDU=0.4 mm; +Y down. Matrices are row-major.
0 // Base/motor cradle adapted from corrected Crossglide; new indexing mechanism and latch.
0 // Standard LDraw geometry remains external; supplied exact placement ledger is authoritative.
0 // Motor leads are integrated motor cables, routed manually below the mechanism; not rigid CAD parts.
0 // Native simulation qualification is not a physical build or hardware accuracy claim.
